---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Deeper Global | Trusted Mental Health Intelligence"
  description="Learn about Deeper Global's mission to make trusted mental health answers more accessible."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <main class="content">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Deeper Global is a public trust layer for mental health questions.</h1>
    <p class="summary">
      The first mission is simple: help people find careful, understandable answers before they make decisions about care.
    </p>

    <h2>What we are building</h2>
    <p>
      Deeper Global is designed as a consumer-facing intelligence layer. The public site organizes vetted answers, topic hubs, and care-seeking language into a resource that can serve readers today and support ethical referral, advertising, and provider intelligence products later.
    </p>

    <h2>Why trust comes first</h2>
    <p>
      Mental health content is sensitive. The platform is built around review status, source tracking, crisis handling, privacy-conscious analytics, and clear boundaries between education and clinical advice.
    </p>

    <h2>How this becomes an ecosystem</h2>
    <p>
      Over time, the same topic and question intelligence can inform Deeper Websites, therapist content strategy, market demand reports, and carefully governed referral pathways without compromising the consumer trust that makes the platform valuable.
    </p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
